    <!-- ================================================================
         BATTERY CHESTS: one crate riding the far end of each belt, holding
         that line's stock. They are what tells the two conveyors apart at a
         glance (red batteries on the right line, blue on the left), together
         with the colour-code stripe on each conveyor's robot-facing frame.
         Visual-only and ~1.8 m out, far past any reachable pose, so they are
         deliberately absent from shield_world.yaml like the rest of the
         scenery. Each crate sits ON the belt (floor at z=0.70) and stays
         inside its belt's y span.
